examples:
示例：
```cpp
class Dog {
public:
    virtual void eat() { std::cout << "The dog ate." << std::endl; }
};

class Bird {
public:
    virtual void eat() { std::cout << "The bird ate." << std::endl; }
};

class DogBird : public Dog, public Bird {};
```
此时：
```cpp
DogBird animal;
animal.eat(); // 调用有歧义
```
因为编译器无法在 `Dog::eat()` 和 `Bird::eat()` 之间自动选择。
